    <p>My goal is to become a Software Developer.</p>

    <h2>My Skills</h2>

    <ul>
        <li>HTML</li>
        <li>CSS</li>
        <li>JavaScript</li>
    </ul>

    <a href="https://github.com">
        Visit GitHub
    </a>

    <br><br>

